# Shared skills

A shared skill is a reusable piece that more than one runbook uses.
Each lives in `skills/<id>/SKILL.md` and follows the open Agent Skills format.

- A stage names the shared skills it uses under "Uses" in its `STAGE.md`.
- The runbook lists them in `depends_on` in `process.yaml`, as `skills/<id>`.
- Changing a shared skill can break every runbook that depends on it. Check `GRAPH.md` for who uses it and rerun their gates before merging.
